  "goodToKnow": "Der Sexismus is sexism: Alltagssexismus (everyday sexism), Sexismus am Arbeitsplatz. Sexistisch means sexist. In 2013, the German hashtag #Aufschrei started a big public debate about everyday sexism, years before #MeToo. Germany's General Equal Treatment Act (AGG, 2006) prohibits discrimination on grounds of sex at work. Like all -ismus nouns, it's masculine. It has no plural."
